# user.md — the human  (box-local: personal data stays out of git)

Copy to user.md and fill in. Keep it under ~400 words: every word rides
every prompt. No secrets — this text is model-visible and log-adjacent.

Name: the display name the agent may speak.
Role: who they are to this agent and to the project.
How they work: session tempo, what "done" means to them, who restarts what.
What they value: what earns trust; what burns it.
Hard rules: the non-negotiables, one line each.
In conversation: how to read their terseness; the humor calibration.
